    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0798" n="1428" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1428"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1868-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 3,
                        1868</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: With reference to your lordship’s
                    circular dispatch of the 11th ultimo, I have the honor to inclose herewith a
                    copy of a report, drawn up by the lawyer employed by this legation, on the state
                    of the Greek law with regard to the nationality of children born of alien
                    parents within the Greek dominions.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. M. ERSKINE.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The Lord <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stanley</hi>, M. P., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d312-a1.xml" xpointer="d312-a1"/>
